    chore(deps): DEPS-005 — bump vitest 5.0.3, @vitest/coverage-v8 5.0.3, @types/node 26.6.4; pin @aws-sdk/client-s3 3.1145.0
    
    Patch/minor sync of the 2026-10-03 supervisor dep-scan. @aws-sdk/client-s3
    3.1146.0 and @modelcontextprotocol/sdk 1.32.0 were published <24h ago and are
    rejected by pnpm's minimumReleaseAge supply-chain policy, so the SDK pins to
    3.1145.0 (published 2026-10-01) and the MCP SDK stays at ^1.31.0. Lockfile
    regenerated fresh; npm ci --dry-run green; tsc clean; full-suite reds are the
    pre-existing host-load FTS-timeout class (reproduce identically on the
    pre-change tree at vitest 5.0.2). simple-git 4.x is a major — out of scope.
    
